				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἱππόδρομος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					4.44
				</span></i>
			:- also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στοά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.68
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάδιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					4.861
				</span></i>
			 (Laodicea ad Lycum): esp. neut. as Subst.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θέατρον, τό,</span>
